S7 real DB / HTTP-TCP integrated load
Date: 2026-08-14 Asia/Tokyo
Environment: PostgreSQL 16.4 (Docker arm64), Python stdlib HTTP servers, psql 14.23 clients
Command: ./run.sh S7LOAD

Topology:
- 2 independent HTTP server processes on 127.0.0.1:18087/18088
- 8 persistent PostgreSQL TCP connections per process (16 total)
- PostgreSQL FORCE RLS on receipt, change and attachment tables
- actual HTTP/TCP loopback traffic
- link behavior emulated in the server: 100ms RTT and 10Mbps serialization

Acceptance:
- push and pull p95 <= 500ms
- idempotent retry creates no duplicate change
- one day: 50 x 1KiB records plus 10 x 100KB photos completes <= 300s
- no request errors and receipt/change/attachment counts remain exact

